cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the version DOI of the snapshot you
  used (and the Expert Systems manuscript once a DOI is assigned).
type: software
title: "Validating Auxiliary Knowledge in Knowledge Tracing: A Credit Protocol and Its Dependence on Setting"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for the Expert Systems manuscript. The pipeline builds
  auxiliary knowledge from training learners only, audits membership
  leakage, compares each knowledge message with a declared control, and
  assigns one of three outcomes from ten paired seeds under an interval
  rule and a seed rule. It is not a new knowledge-tracing predictor.
  Pairwise train-only graph construction is reused from
  edu-risk-lab/leakage-controlled-kt-audit at commit 5e3d6a0.
